.TH lprint-drivers 1 "LPrint" "2026-06-03" "Michael R Sweet"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
lprint-drivers \- list drivers supported by the print server.
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.B lprint
.B drivers
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
This command lists the supported printer drivers.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
The \fB\-o device-id=\fIDEVICE-ID\fR option will limit the list to drivers
matching the specified IEEE-1284 device ID.
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.BR lprint (1),
.BR lprint-add (1),
.BR lprint-devices (1),
.BR lprint-modify (1).
.SH "حق نشر (COPYRIGHT)"
Copyright \[co] 2019-2026 by Michael R Sweet.
